ad-advanced-heading\"},{\"id\":\"7bf9cad\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>About taking consistent, purposeful actions toward your dreams, embracing each step of the journey, and trusting in the power of persistence to bring your vision to life.<\\/p>\",\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"30\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"8aaecb8\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"tabs\":[{\"icon\":{\"value\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/demo.hashthemes.com\\/total\\/construction\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/sites\\/9\\/2025\\/02\\/mission.svg\",\"id\":696},\"library\":\"svg\"},\"title\":\"Our Mission\",\"wisiwyg_content\":\"<p>Our mission in building this company is to create a lasting impact by delivering innovative solutions, fostering a culture of collaboration, and driving sustainable growth.<\\/p>\",\"_id\":\"63f414d\"},{\"icon\":{\"value\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/demo.hashthemes.com\\/total\\/construction\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/sites\\/9\\/2025\\/02\\/vision.svg\",\"id\":697},\"library\":\"svg\"},\"title\":\"Our Vision\",\"wisiwyg_content\":\"<p>Our vision is to be a pioneering force in our industry, shaping the future through innovation, creativity, and excellence. We aim to build a company that not only leads in performance.<\\/p>\",\"_id\":\"206df68\"},{\"icon\":{\"value\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/demo.hashthemes.com\\/total\\/construction\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/sites\\/9\\/2025\\/02\\/history.svg\",\"id\":698},\"library\":\"svg\"},\"title\":\"Our History\",\"wisiwyg_content\":\"<p>We are UNITE, based in Tamil Nadu, India, and established in 2018, we proudly serve clients worldwide, catering to their Mechanical, Civil, and Structural Steel Engineering needs. Our team comprises highly experienced engineers, committed to delivering excellence across every project.<\\/p><p>We have an extensive portfolio spanning diverse sectors, including the commercial and indust