\"63f414d\"},{\"icon\":{\"value\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/demo.hashthemes.com\\/total\\/construction\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/sites\\/9\\/2025\\/02\\/vision.svg\",\"id\":697},\"library\":\"svg\"},\"title\":\"Our Vision\",\"wisiwyg_content\":\"<p>Our vision is to be a pioneering force in our industry, shaping the future through innovation, creativity, and excellence. We aim to build a company that not only leads in performance.<\\/p>\",\"_id\":\"206df68\"},{\"icon\":{\"value\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/demo.hashthemes.com\\/total\\/construction\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/sites\\/9\\/2025\\/02\\/history.svg\",\"id\":698},\"library\":\"svg\"},\"title\":\"Our History\",\"wisiwyg_content\":\"<p>We are UNITE, based in Tamil Nadu, India, and established in 2018, we proudly serve clients worldwide, catering to their Mechanical, Civil, and Structural Steel Engineering needs. Our team comprises highly experienced engineers, committed to delivering excellence across every project.<\\/p><p>We have an extensive portfolio spanning diverse sectors, including the commercial and industrial domains, with expertise in Oil &amp; Gas as well as Building and Infrastructure projects.<\\/p><p>Our technical expertise, combined with streamlined process methodologies, ensures the delivery of responsive, high-quality, and cost-effective solutions. Equipped with cutting-edge 3D and 2D software tools, we consistently achieve precision and efficiency in our work.<\\/p>\",\"_id\":\"801d3fc\"}],\"tab_content_animation\":\"zoomIn\",\"tab_container_border_border\":\"\",\"tab_background\":\"#F8F8F8\",\"tab_border_border\":\"\",\"tab_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"tab_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":18,\"sizes\":[]},\"tab_typography_font_weight\":\"500\",\"tab_icon_position\":\"left\",\"tab_icon_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":25,\"sizes\":[]},\"tab_buttons_alignment\":\"stretch\",\"tab_button_bg_color_active\":\"#FB5B11\",\"tab_button_text_color_active\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"tab_content_bg_co