 project.<\\/p><p>We have an extensive portfolio spanning diverse sectors, including the commercial and industrial domains, with expertise in Oil &amp; Gas as well as Building and Infrastructure projects.<\\/p><p>Our technical expertise, combined with streamlined process methodologies, ensures the delivery of responsive, high-quality, and cost-effective solutions. Equipped with cutting-edge 3D and 2D software tools, we consistently achieve precision and efficiency in our work.<\\/p>\",\"_id\":\"801d3fc\"}],\"tab_content_animation\":\"zoomIn\",\"tab_container_border_border\":\"\",\"tab_background\":\"#F8F8F8\",\"tab_border_border\":\"\",\"tab_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"tab_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":18,\"sizes\":[]},\"tab_typography_font_weight\":\"500\",\"tab_icon_position\":\"left\",\"tab_icon_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":25,\"sizes\":[]},\"tab_buttons_alignment\":\"stretch\",\"tab_button_bg_color_active\":\"#FB5B11\",\"tab_button_text_color_active\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"tab_content_bg_color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"tab_content_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"30\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"30\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"eead-horizontal-tab\"},{\"id\":\"fd7dbc8\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_gap\":{\"column\":\"20\",\"row\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":true,\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":20}},\"elements\":[],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"9df2902\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"boxed_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1140,\"sizes\":[]},\"flex_gap\":{\"column\":\"50\",\"row\":\"50\",\"isLinked\":true,\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":50},\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"#F3F3F3\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"80\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"160\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"b54296d\",\"elType\":\"widget\",