"#FB5B11\",\"sub_heading_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"sub_heading_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":18,\"sizes\":[]},\"sub_heading_typography_font_weight\":\"600\",\"sub_heading_typography_text_transform\":\"capitalize\",\"main_heading_color\":\"#020101\",\"main_heading_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"main_heading_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":42,\"sizes\":[]},\"main_heading_typography_font_weight\":\"700\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"eead-advanced-heading\"},{\"id\":\"8c10521\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"testimonial_block\":[{\"_id\":\"d24d794\",\"name\":\"Rengasamy\",\"designation\":\"CEO\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8080\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/05\\/team7.jpg\",\"id\":706,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\",\"size\":\"\"},\"testimonial\":\"Dark troubles, someone on the run, opens up to pain and shifting accusations over time \\u2014 severe, persistent pain, burdensome obligations, work, distress \\u2014 possible elegance in a noble form, leaning toward clarity and purpose. From structured law: freedom granted, dignified refinement in noble posture. Burdens and dignities, again with that refinement.\"},{\"_id\":\"c0f7d52\",\"name\":\"Miya Martin\",\"designation\":\"Program Incharge\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8080\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/05\\/team8.jpg\",\"id\":707,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\",\"size\":\"\"},\"testimonial\":\"Because of hidden matters, a certain class or category offers no real value \\u2014 now entrusted with fleeting duties, almost finished. Harsh judgments and deep burdens emerge. Yet freedom lies in simple structure, though complications follow. Certain consequences take shape, surrounding everything with tension and design. Still, through disorder and conflict, there\\u2019s strength, honor, and the possibility of rising above.\"},{\"_id\":\"8b20a10\",\"name\":\"Alena Due\",\"designation\":\"Make Up Artist\",\"image\":{\"url\"