ons:<\\/strong> Showing the steel structure from the side, including the height of each steel member.<\\/li><li><strong>Sections:<\\/strong> Showing the steel structure in cross-section, including the thickness and size of each steel member.<\\/li><li><strong>Details:<\\/strong>\\u00a0Showing the specific connections and joints between steel members, including bolts, welds, and other fasteners.<br \\/><br \\/>In addition to these drawings, we also provide material lists, connection designs, and erection plans to ensure that the steel structure is built to the highest quality standards. Our steel detailing service is ideal for all types of steel structures, including bridges, buildings, and industrial facilities.<br \\/><img class=\\\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1090 entered litespeed-loaded\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.esskaystructures.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/06\\/steel-detailing-model.webp\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 625px) 100vw, 625px\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.esskaystructures.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/06\\/steel-detailing-model.webp 625w, https:\\/\\/www.esskaystructures.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/06\\/steel-detailing-model-300x273.webp 300w\\\" alt=\\\"steel detailing services\\\" width=\\\"625\\\" height=\\\"568\\\" data-lazyloaded=\\\"1\\\" data-src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.esskaystructures.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/06\\/steel-detailing-model.webp\\\" data-srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.esskaystructures.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/06\\/steel-detailing-model.webp 625w, https:\\/\\/www.esskaystructures.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/06\\/steel-detailing-model-300x273.webp 300w\\\" data-sizes=\\\"(max-width: 625px) 100vw, 625px\\\" data-ll-status=\\\"loaded\\\" \\/><\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"align\":\"left\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"bbf0d57\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"structure\":\"20\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\