",\"sub_heading_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"sub_heading_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":18,\"sizes\":[]},\"sub_heading_typography_font_weight\":\"600\",\"sub_heading_typography_text_transform\":\"capitalize\",\"main_heading_color\":\"#020101\",\"main_heading_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"main_heading_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":42,\"sizes\":[]},\"main_heading_typography_font_weight\":\"700\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"eead-advanced-heading\"},{\"id\":\"0934fc7\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>We provide detailed design calculations for connections and miscellaneous steel structures. We ensure that our connection design meets the preferences of our clients and meets the highest standards of quality and safety.<\\/p><p>Our design services include:<\\/p><ul><li>Design of steel connections, including beam-to-beam, beam-to-column, splices, trusses, and brace connections to American and European Standards.<\\/li><li>Designing custom connections to suit specific project requirements.<\\/li><li>Analysis and design of miscellaneous steel structures such as stairs, ladders, platforms, and handrails.<\\/li><\\/ul><p>Our internally developed standard connection design and details help to reduce design time. Our designs are based on RISA connection design software, STAAD Pro, and internally developed Excel and Mathcad worksheets. We provide timely and cost-effective solutions that meet the highest standards of quality and safety.<br \\/><br \\/><img class=\\\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-934 entered litespeed-loaded\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.esskaystructures.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/02\\/Connection-Design-copy.webp\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 625px) 100vw, 625px\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.esskaystructures.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/02\\/Connection-Design-copy.webp 625w, https:\\/\\/www.esskaystructures.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/02\\/Connection-Design-copy-3