cellaneous steel structures such as stairs, ladders, platforms, and handrails.<\\/li><\\/ul><p>Our internally developed standard connection design and details help to reduce design time. Our designs are based on RISA connection design software, STAAD Pro, and internally developed Excel and Mathcad worksheets. We provide timely and cost-effective solutions that meet the highest standards of quality and safety.<br \\/><br \\/><img class=\\\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-934 entered litespeed-loaded\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.esskaystructures.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/02\\/Connection-Design-copy.webp\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 625px) 100vw, 625px\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.esskaystructures.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/02\\/Connection-Design-copy.webp 625w, https:\\/\\/www.esskaystructures.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/02\\/Connection-Design-copy-300x273.webp 300w\\\" alt=\\\"Connection detailing services\\\" width=\\\"625\\\" height=\\\"568\\\" data-lazyloaded=\\\"1\\\" data-src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.esskaystructures.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/02\\/Connection-Design-copy.webp\\\" data-srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.esskaystructures.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/02\\/Connection-Design-copy.webp 625w, https:\\/\\/www.esskaystructures.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/02\\/Connection-Design-copy-300x273.webp 300w\\\" data-sizes=\\\"(max-width: 625px) 100vw, 625px\\\" data-ll-status=\\\"loaded\\\" \\/><\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"1e9b3a3\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Apply For Services\",\"secondary_text\":\"Click Here\",\"effect\":\"effect-8\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":20,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"500\",\"link_color_hover\":\"#FB5B11\",\"link_border_color_hover\":\"#FB5B11\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"eead-link-effect\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"87102d8\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"