,{\"id\":\"fe5992b\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Our steel detailing service is a specialized service that focuses on creating highly precise and accurate drawings for steel structures. We work with architects, engineers, and contractors to ensure that the steel structure is designed and built to the highest quality standards and meets all local building codes and safety regulations. Our team of experienced detailers uses the latest software and technology to create detailed shop and erection drawings, including:<\\/p><ul><li><strong>Plans:<\\/strong> Showing the layout of the steel structure from above, including the location of all steel members.<\\/li><li><strong>Elevations:<\\/strong> Showing the steel structure from the side, including the height of each steel member.<\\/li><li><strong>Sections:<\\/strong> Showing the steel structure in cross-section, including the thickness and size of each steel member.<\\/li><li><strong>Details:<\\/strong>\\u00a0Showing the specific connections and joints between steel members, including bolts, welds, and other fasteners.<br \\/><br \\/>In addition to these drawings, we also provide material lists, connection designs, and erection plans to ensure that the steel structure is built to the highest quality standards. Our steel detailing service is ideal for all types of steel structures, including bridges, buildings, and industrial facilities.<br \\/><img class=\\\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1090 entered litespeed-loaded\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.esskaystructures.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/06\\/steel-detailing-model.webp\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 625px) 100vw, 625px\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.esskaystructures.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/06\\/steel-detailing-model.webp 625w, https:\\/\\/www.esskaystructures.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/06\\/steel-detailing-model-300x273.webp 300w\\\" alt=\\\"steel detailing services\\\" width=\\\"625\\\" height=\\\"568\\\" data-lazyloaded=\\\"1\\\" data-src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.esskaystructures.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/06\\/steel-detailing-model.webp\\\" data-srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.esskaystructures.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/06\\/steel-detailing-model.webp 625w, https:\\/\\/www.esskaystructures.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/06\\/steel-detailing-model-300x273.webp 300w\\\" data-sizes=\\\"(max-width: 625px) 100vw, 625px\\\" data-ll-status=\\\"loaded\\\" \\/><\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"align\":\"left\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"6288ea4\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Apply For Services\",\"secondary_text\":\"Click Here\",\"effect\":\"effect-8\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":20,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"500\",\"link_color_hover\":\"#FB5B11\",\"link_border_color_hover\":\"#FB5B11\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"eead-link-effect\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"f9d5504\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":33,\"width\":{\"size\":48,\"unit\":\"%\"},\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8080\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/05\\/02.jpg\",\"id\":843,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\",\"size\":\"\"},\"background_attachment\":\"fixed\",\"background_size\":\"initial\",\"content_width\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"a752748\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":50,\"column\":\"50\",\"row\":\"50\",\"isLinked\":true},\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/demo.hashthemes.com\\/total\\/construction\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/sites\\/9\\/2025\\/02\\/hero-image.jpg\",\"id\":828,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"background_position\":\"top center\",\"background_attachment\":\"fixed\",\"background_repeat\":\"no-repeat\",\"backgr