rength, honor, and the possibility of rising above.\"},{\"_id\":\"8b20a10\",\"name\":\"Alena Due\",\"designation\":\"Project Manger\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8080\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/05\\/team4.jpg\",\"id\":708,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\",\"size\":\"\"},\"testimonial\":\"Troubles grow subtly, hidden yet clear to some \\u2014 who he is, what he carries. Simple movements reveal something deeper. He is now blamed. In the depths, as he follows great burdens, he moves forward \\u2014 pursued and empty, yet filled with a kind of grace and purpose. Pause. In the tension of desires and the weight of expectations, there is potential, beauty, and the chance for connection.\"}],\"nav_normal_bg_color\":\"#FB5B11\",\"nav_hover_bg_color\":\"\",\"nav_icon_hover_color\":\"\",\"dot_bg_color_hover\":\"\",\"name_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"name_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":24,\"sizes\":[]},\"name_typography_font_weight\":\"600\",\"designation_color\":\"#928686\",\"designation_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"designation_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":18,\"sizes\":[]},\"thumb_outline_color\":\"#4B4A4A\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"total-testimonial-slider\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false}]'),(2611,982,'_elementor_controls_usage','a:8:{s:7:\"heading\";a:3:{s:5:\"count\";i:6;s:15:\"control_percent\";i:3;s:8:\"controls\";a:2:{s:7:\"content\";a:1:{s:13:\"section_title\";a:3:{s:5:\"title\";i:6;s:5:\"align\";i:5;s:11:\"header_size\";i:2;}}s:5:\"style\";a:1:{s:19:\"section_title_style\";a:7:{s:11:\"title_color\";i:6;s:21:\"typography_typography\";i:6;s:20:\"typography_font_size\";i:6;s:25:\"typography_text_transform\";i:2;s:22:\"typography_font_family\";i:1;s:22:\"typography_font_weight\";i:1;s:22:\"typography_line_height\";i:3;}}}}s:6:\"column\";a:3:{s:5:\"count\";i:22;s:15:\"control_percent\";i:0;s:8:\"controls\";a:2:{s:6:\"layout\";a:1:{s:6:\"layout\";a:2:{s:12:\"_inline_size\";i:22;s:21: