lType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>We are UNITE, based in Tamil Nadu, India, and established in 2018, we proudly serve clients worldwide, catering to their Mechanical, Civil, and Structural Steel Engineering needs. Our team comprises highly experienced engineers, committed to delivering excellence across every project.<\\/p>\",\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"30\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"8aaecb8\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"tabs\":[{\"icon\":{\"value\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/demo.hashthemes.com\\/total\\/construction\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/sites\\/9\\/2025\\/02\\/mission.svg\",\"id\":696},\"library\":\"svg\"},\"title\":\"Our Mission\",\"wisiwyg_content\":\"<p>Our mission is to provide outstanding performance to our clients by delivering projects on time by using the <br \\/>latest technologies with empowered people for satisfying the schedules and specifications.<\\/p>\",\"_id\":\"63f414d\"},{\"icon\":{\"value\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/demo.hashthemes.com\\/total\\/construction\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/sites\\/9\\/2025\\/02\\/vision.svg\",\"id\":697},\"library\":\"svg\"},\"title\":\"Our Vision\",\"wisiwyg_content\":\"<p>To become a leader in Engineering services and provide best-in-class Steel Detailing services to our client<br \\/>with quality.<\\/p>\",\"_id\":\"206df68\"},{\"icon\":{\"value\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/demo.hashthemes.com\\/total\\/construction\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/sites\\/9\\/2025\\/02\\/history.svg\",\"id\":698},\"library\":\"svg\"},\"title\":\"Our History\",\"wisiwyg_content\":\"<p>We are UNITE, based in Tamil Nadu, India, and established in 2018, we proudly serve clients worldwide, catering to their Mechanical, Civil, and Structural Steel Engineering needs. Our team comprises highly experienced engineers, committed to delivering excellence across every project.<\\/p><p>We have an extensive portfolio spanning dive