eading\"},{\"id\":\"8c10521\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"testimonial_block\":[{\"_id\":\"d24d794\",\"name\":\"Rengasamy\",\"designation\":\"CEO\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8080\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/05\\/team7.jpg\",\"id\":706,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\",\"size\":\"\"},\"testimonial\":\"Dark troubles, someone on the run, opens up to pain and shifting accusations over time \\u2014 severe, persistent pain, burdensome obligations, work, distress \\u2014 possible elegance in a noble form, leaning toward clarity and purpose. From structured law: freedom granted, dignified refinement in noble posture. Burdens and dignities, again with that refinement.\"},{\"_id\":\"c0f7d52\",\"name\":\"Miya Martin\",\"designation\":\"Program Incharge\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8080\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/05\\/team8.jpg\",\"id\":707,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\",\"size\":\"\"},\"testimonial\":\"Because of hidden matters, a certain class or category offers no real value \\u2014 now entrusted with fleeting duties, almost finished. Harsh judgments and deep burdens emerge. Yet freedom lies in simple structure, though complications follow. Certain consequences take shape, surrounding everything with tension and design. Still, through disorder and conflict, there\\u2019s strength, honor, and the possibility of rising above.\"},{\"_id\":\"8b20a10\",\"name\":\"Alena Due\",\"designation\":\"Project Manger\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8080\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/05\\/team4.jpg\",\"id\":708,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\",\"size\":\"\"},\"testimonial\":\"Troubles grow subtly, hidden yet clear to some \\u2014 who he is, what he carries. Simple movements reveal something deeper. He is now blamed. In the depths, as he follows great burdens, he moves forward \\u2014 pursued and empty, yet filled with a kind of grace and purpose. Pause. In the tension of desires and the weight of expectations, there is potential, beauty, and the chance for connection.\"}],\"nav_normal_bg_color\":\"#FB5B11\",\"nav_hover_bg_color\":\"\",\"nav_icon_hover_color\":\"\",\"dot_bg_color_hover\":\"\",\"name_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"name_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":24,\"sizes\":[]},\"name_typography_font_weight\":\"600\",\"designation_color\":\"#928686\",\"designation_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"designation_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":18,\"sizes\":[]},\"thumb_outline_color\":\"#4B4A4A\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"total-testimonial-slider\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"66f9c2a\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"flex_gap\":{\"column\":\"59\",\"row\":\"59\",\"isLinked\":true,\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":59},\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"#F3F3F3\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"80\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"80\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"ef83a70\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"sub_heading\":\"Our Blog\",\"main_heading\":\"Latest Insights and Updates\",\"split_text\":\"Split Text\",\"advanced_heading_visibility\":\"\",\"advanced_heading\":\"Background Text\",\"sub_heading_color\":\"#FB5B11\",\"sub_heading_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"sub_heading_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":18,\"sizes\":[]},\"sub_heading_typography_font_weight\":\"600\",\"sub_heading_typography_text_transform\":\"capitalize\",\"main_heading_color\":\"#020101\",\"main_heading_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"main_heading_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":42,\"sizes\":[]},\"main_heading_typography_font_weight\":\"700\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"eead-advanced-heading\"},{\"id\":\"6c1d1f1\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"posts_category_ids\":[\"2\"],\"bottom_border_color\":\"#FB5B11\",\"normal_button_bg_color\":\"#FB5B11\",\"_background_background\":\"gradient\"},\