                         +                            \n                            1                        \n                    <h4>\n                        Complete Projects                    </h4>\n                                +                            \n                            1                        \n                    <h4>\n                        Team Members                    </h4>\n                                +                            \n                            1                        \n                    <h4>\n                        Client Reviews                    </h4>\n                                +                            \n                            1                        \n                    <h4>\n                        Winning Awards                    </h4>\n            Team Members<h4>Our Key Achievements Over the Years</h4>        \n                    <img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2021/07/teama.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />                \n                    <h4>Andrea Spliber</h4><h5>Project Manager</h5>                \n                    <img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2021/07/teamb.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />                \n                    <h4>Celsiya Malocm</h4><h5>Building Advisor</h5>                \n                    <img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2021/07/teamc.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />                \n                    <h4>Nelson Mecoy</h4><h5>Architecture</h5>                \n                    <img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2021/07/teamd.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />                \n                    <h4>Chris Russell</h4><h5>Builder</h5>                \n            Our Happy Clients<h4>We Care About Your Opinion</h4>        \n                        Dark troubles, someone on the run, opens up to pain and shifting accusations over time — severe, persistent pain, burdensome obligations, work, distress — possible elegance in a noble form, leaning toward clarity and purpose. From structured law: freedom granted, dignified refinement in noble posture. Burdens and dignities, again with that refinement.                    \n                    <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/team7.jpg\" alt=\"team7\" />\n                    <h6>Rengasamy</h6>\n                            CEO                        \n                        Because of hidden matters, a certain class or category offers no real value — now entrusted with fleeting duties, almost finished. Harsh judgments and deep burdens emerge. Yet freedom lies in simple structure, though complications follow. Certain consequences take shape, surrounding everything with tension and design. Still, through disorder and conflict, there’s strength, honor, and the possibility of rising above.                    \n                    <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/team8.jpg\" alt=\"team8\" />\n                    <h6>Miya Martin</h6>\n                            Program Incharge                        \n                        Troubles grow subtly, hidden yet clear to some — who he is, what he carries. Simple movements reveal something deeper. He is now blamed. In the depths, as he follows great burdens, he moves forward — pursued and empty, yet filled with a kind of grace and purpose. Pause. In the tension of desires and the weight of expectations, there is potential, beauty, and the chance for connection.                    \n                    <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/team4.jpg\" alt=\"team4\" />\n                    <h6>Alena Due</h6>\n                            Project Manger','About Us','','publish','closed','closed','','about-us','','','2025-05-08 16:28:39','2025-05-08 16:28:39','',0,'https://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/?page_id=121',0,'page','',0),(123,1,'2020-10-13 05:52:33','2020-10-13 05:52:33','<h1>Projects</h1>				\n            Our Works<h4>Latest Projects</h4>        \n                            All                        \n                            APOC PP PLANT                        \n                            CHILDREN’S PARK                        \n                            PERDAMAN CHEMICALS                        \n                            VILLAGE MD                        \n                                <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Loop-Reactor.jpeg\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Loop-Reactor.jpeg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"no\">\n                                                                            </a>\n                                <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Circular-platform.jpg\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Circular-platform.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"no\">\n                                                                            </a>\n                                <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Small-Circular-platform.jpeg\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Small-Circular-platform.jpeg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"no\">\n                                                                            </a>\n                                <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/imageschildran.jpg\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/imageschildran.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"no\">\n                                                                            </a>\n                                <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/apoc-7.jpg\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/apoc-7.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"no\">\n                                                                            </a>\n                                <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/11197-17863537.jpg\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/11197-17863537.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"no\">\n                                                                            </a>\n                                <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/apoc-5.jpg\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/apoc-5.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"no\">\n                                                                            </a>\n                                <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/cimages.jpg\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/cimages.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"no\">\n                                                                            </a>\n                                <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Untitled4.jpg\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Untitled4.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"no\">\n                                                                            </a>\n                                <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Web_Photo_Editor.jpg\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Web_Photo_Editor.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"no\">\n                                                                            </a>\n                                <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/3N18N6-1.png\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/3N18N6-1.png\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"no\">\n                                                                            </a>\n                                <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/egV4Pv.jpg\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/egV4Pv.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"no\">\n                                                                            </a>\n            <h4>List Of Projects</h4>        \n                        <h3>APOC PP PLANT</h3>\n                            <p>Project Summary:</p><p>We successfully completed the following</p><p>Modelling and detailing of accessing platforms and staircases for two loop reactors .</p><p>Modelling and detailing of 30 circular platforms.</p><p>These projects have significantly enhanced our expertise and knowledge, preparing us to take on more challenging and ambitious endeavours in the future.</p><p>Location : SAUDI ARABIA</p><p>Tonnage : 450 Tons<br /><br /><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Circular-platform-132x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"132\" height=\"300\" /> <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Loop-Reactor-155x300.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"155\" height=\"300\" /><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Small-Circular-platform-1-251x300.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"251\" height=\"300\" /></p>                        \n                        <h3>HAWIYAH EAST WEST GAS</h3>\n                            <p>Project Summary:</p><p>We successfully completed the Modelling and detailing of accessing platforms, pipe supports, and ring girders.</p><p>The project was completed successfully, and the models were seamlessly integrated into a single file for Building Information Modelling (BIM).</p><p>Additionally, we designed the connections for the pipe supports.</p><p>Location : SAUDI ARABIA</p><p>Tonnage : 200 Tons<br /><br /><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Scraper-Launcher-and-Receiver-project-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" /><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Scraper-Launcher-and-Receiver-project-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" /><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Web_Photo_Editor1-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" /></p>                        \n                        <h3>FIRE WATER PUMP STATION BULIDING</h3>\n                            <p>Project Summary:</p><p>We successfully completed the modelling and detailing of the fire water pump station building structure.</p><p>Through this project, we gained valuable insights into PEP building standards.</p><p>Location : OMAN</p><p>Tonnage : 125 Tons<br /><br /><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/apoc-6-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" /></p>                        \n                        <h3>KALLANG FOOTBALL HUB</h3>\n                            <p>Project Summary:</p><p>We take pride in successfully completing the modification and detailing work for a football stadium.</p><p>This project posed significant challenges, as it involved implementing design change modifications and corrections. Through our dedicated efforts, we delivered results that fully met the client’s expectations and requirements.<br /><br />Location : SINGAPORE<br /><br />Tonnage : 750 Tons<br /><br /><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/apoc-4-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" /></p>                        \n                        <h3>PERDAMAN CHEMICALS</h3>\n                            <p>Project Summary:</p><p>We successfully completed the modelling and detailing of skids.<br />This project provided valuable insights into trade coordination, particularly with piping and equipment.<br /><br />Location : AUSTRALIA<br /><br />Tonnage : 20 Tons (10 Skids)<br /><br /><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/apoc-5-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" /></p>                        \n                        <h3>VILLAGE MD</h3>\n                            <p>Project Summary:</p><p>We successfully completed the modelling and detailing of stairs.</p><p>The stair connections were securely integrated with the concrete, ensuring a smooth process without any erection issues.<br /><br />Location : USA<br /><br />Tonnage : 7.5 Tons<br /> <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/3N18N6-1-239x300.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"239\" height=\"300\" /><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/egV4Pv-225x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"300\" /></p>                        \n                        <h3>CHILDREN’S PARK</h3>\n                            <p>Project Summary:</p><p>We successfully completed the modelling and detailing of a truss.</p><p>Despite challenges in achieving the truss valley during modelling, we gained valuable insights from the visually simple truss park.</p><p>Location : SAUDI ARABIA</p><p>Tonnage : 40 Tons (4 Sets)</p><p><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/apoc-8-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" /> <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/apoc-7-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" /></p>                        \n															<img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/banner-img.jpg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />','Projects','','publish','closed','closed','','projects','','','2025-05-07 18:18:08','2025-05-07 18:18:08','',0,'https://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/?page_id=123',0,'page','',0),(124,1,'2025-04-29 05:52:33','2025-04-29 05:52:33','<h1>Contact Us</h1>				\n            Contact Us<h4>Get in touch with Unite</h4>        \n									<h4>\n							Contact Phone						\n					</h4>\n									<p>\n						+91 90259 63647 <br>\n+91 95436 69218					</p>\n									<h3>\n							Contact Mail						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						ute@unitete.com					</p>\n									<h3>\n							Contact Location						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						<strong>Registered: </strong>18, Ezhil nagar, Keeranur, <br>Pudukottai - Tamilnadu - India. <br>\n<strong>Business:</strong> 107/1, Samanthi street, J K Nagar, <br>Trichy - Tamilnadu - India.					</p>\n									<h3>\n							Opening Hours						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						Mon- Fri: 10.00 - 07.00					</p>\n            Get In Touch<h4>We’d love to hear from you</h4>        \n            <form enctype=\"multipart/form-data\" method=\"post\" id=\"hf-form-id-g0kwmj\" novalidate>\n        <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"hashform_action\" value=\"create\" />\n        <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"form_id\" value=\"1\" />\n        <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"form_key\" value=\"g0kwmj\" />\n        <input type=\"hidden\" value=\"[]\" />\n        <input type=\"hidden\" id=\"hashform_submit_entry_1\" name=\"hashform_submit_entry_1\" value=\"ff149dabc6\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wp_http_referer\" value=\"/wp-admin/admin-ajax.php\" />        \n                    <input type=\"text\" id=\"hf-field-4d02kf-full\" value=\"\" name=\"item_meta[1][full]\" placeholder=\"Your Name\">\n                    <input type=\"text\" id=\"