 an existing structure to enhance its functionality and efficiency.</p>                    \n                                <a href=\"#\">\n                View More            </a>\n                                            <img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/flooring-roofing.jpg\" alt=\"Flooring &amp; Roofing\">\n                            <h4>\n                        Flooring &amp; Roofing                    \n                </h4>\n                        <p>The installation, repair, and maintenance of surfaces and coverings that provide durability, protection.</p>                    \n                                <a href=\"#\">\n                View More            </a>\n                                            <img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/general-contracting.jpg\" alt=\"General Contracting\">\n                            <h4>\n                        General Contracting                    \n                </h4>\n                        <p>Management and execution of construction projects and subcontractors to ensure timely and quality completion.</p>                    \n                                <a href=\"#\">\n                View More            </a>\n                                            <img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/repair-expand.jpg\" alt=\"Repair &amp; Expand\">\n                            <h4>\n                        Repair &amp; Expand                    \n                </h4>\n                        <p>Involves restoring damaged structures and extending existing spaces to enhance functionality and safety.</p>                    \n                                <a href=\"#\">\n                View More            </a>','Building Construction','','publish','closed','closed','','building-construction','','','2025-05-01 10:14:06','2025-05-01 10:14: