mo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2021/07/teamc-100x100.png 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 450px) 100vw, 450px\" />                \n                    <h4>Nelson Mecoy</h4><h5>Architecture</h5>                \n                    <img width=\"450\" height=\"450\" src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2021/07/teamd.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2021/07/teamd.png 450w, https://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2021/07/teamd-300x300.png 300w, https://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2021/07/teamd-150x150.png 150w, https://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2021/07/teamd-400x400.png 400w, https://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2021/07/teamd-100x100.png 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 450px) 100vw, 450px\" />                \n                    <h4>Chris Russell</h4><h5>Builder</h5>                \n            Our Happy Clients<h4>We Care About Your Opinion</h4>        \n                        Turpis laborum cumque fugit aperiam doloremque in varius fugit tempore accusamus dui dolor, maxime maxime debitis, labore harum nonummy possimus aenean ad, integer leo adipiscing quia phasellus! Nec dictumst ab! Accumsan soluta, penatibus dignissim nonummy sit. Debitis doloremque dignissimos, nonummy.                    \n                    <img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2021/03/team7.jpg\" alt=\"team7\" />\n                    <h6>Jason Doe</h6>\n                            Program Incharge                        \n                        Quod occaecati class facilisis nihil augue do, nunc id perferendis provident fugit donec quasi. Atque odit gravida tincidunt excepteur, impedit! Donec soluta orci quibusdam, consequuntur diam omnis rem tortor eius scelerisque quo interdum auctor laudantium architecto adipisicing maxime corporis possimus.                    \n                    <img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2021/03/team8.jpg\" alt=\"team8\" />\n                    <h6>Miya Martin</h6>\n                            CEO                        \n                        Ultrices nec sem excepteur perspiciatis, quas sint eum. Facilis eleifend dis aliquid! Culpa nunc accusantium. Lacus mauris eaque, dui sequi suscipit magnis, sagittis ducimus, dui ullam nihil magnam ullamco blandit egestas voluptas! Sit! Vulputate voluptatibus aute, vel et possimus consectetur.                    \n                    <img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2021/03/team4.jpg\" alt=\"team4\" />\n                    <h6>Alena Due</h6>\n                            Make Up Artist','About Us','','inherit','closed','closed','','121-revision-v1','','','2025-05-01 04:28:46','2025-05-01 04:28:46','',121,'http://localhost:8080/?p=675',0,'revision','',0),(676,1,'2025-05-01 04:28:51','2025-05-01 04:28:51','<h1>About Us</h1>				\n            Professional &amp; Modern<h4>Designing a Life of Style and Sophistication</h4>        \n		<p>Elevate your everyday experiences with a blend of elegance, refinement, and modern sophistication. From fashion and decor to personal growth and cultural appreciation, designing a stylish life means curating an existence that reflects your unique tastes and aspirations.</p>		\n            <ul>\n                                        <li>\n                                 Best Quality Support                            \n                                                    </li>\n                                                <li>\n                                100% Quality Design                            \n                                                    </li>\n                                                <l