 src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2021/07/teama.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />                \n                    <h4>Andrea Spliber</h4><h5>Project Manager</h5>                \n                    <img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2021/07/teamb.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />                \n                    <h4>Celsiya Malocm</h4><h5>Building Advisor</h5>                \n                    <img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2021/07/teamc.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />                \n                    <h4>Nelson Mecoy</h4><h5>Architecture</h5>                \n                    <img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2021/07/teamd.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />                \n                    <h4>Chris Russell</h4><h5>Builder</h5>                \n            Our Happy Clients<h4>We Care About Your Opinion</h4>        \n                        Turpis laborum cumque fugit aperiam doloremque in varius fugit tempore accusamus dui dolor, maxime maxime debitis, labore harum nonummy possimus aenean ad, integer leo adipiscing quia phasellus! Nec dictumst ab! Accumsan soluta, penatibus dignissim nonummy sit. Debitis doloremque dignissimos, nonummy.                    \n                    <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/team7.jpg\" alt=\"team7\" />\n                    <h6>Jason Doe</h6>\n                            Program Incharge                        \n                        Quod occaecati class facilisis nihil augue do, nunc id perferendis provident fugit donec quasi. Atque odit gravida tincidunt excepteur, impedit! Donec soluta orci quibusdam, consequuntur diam omnis rem tortor eius scelerisque quo interdum auctor laudantium architecto adipisicing maxime corporis possimus.                    \n                    <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/team8.jpg\" alt=\"team8\" />\n                    <h6>Miya Martin</h6>\n                            CEO                        \n                        Ultrices nec sem excepteur perspiciatis, quas sint eum. Facilis eleifend dis aliquid! Culpa nunc accusantium. Lacus mauris eaque, dui sequi suscipit magnis, sagittis ducimus, dui ullam nihil magnam ullamco blandit egestas voluptas! Sit! Vulputate voluptatibus aute, vel et possimus consectetur.                    \n                    <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/team4.jpg\" alt=\"team4\" />\n                    <h6>Alena Due</h6>\n                            Make Up Artist','About Us','','inherit','closed','closed','','121-revision-v1','','','2025-05-01 05:11:41','2025-05-01 05:11:41','',121,'http://localhost:8080/?p=764',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (765,1,'2025-05-01 05:14:04','2025-05-01 05:14:04','<img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/slider-1.jpg\">                                                            \n                                            WE ARE  UNITE TECHNOCRATS                                        \n                            <img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/slider-2.jpg\">                                                            \n                                            WE ARE DOING STRUCTURAL DESIGN                                        \n                            <img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/slider-3.jpg\">                                                            \n                                            WE ARE DESIGN, DETAILING, FABRICATION                                        \n            Designing the Future<h4>Turning Vision into Reality, One Step at a Time</h4>        \n		<p>About taking consistent, purposeful actions toward your dreams, embracing each step of the journey, and trusting in the power of persistence to bring your vision to life.</p>		\n                                                Our Mission\n                                                Our Vision\n                                                Our History\n                        <p>Our mission in building this company is to create a lasting impact by delivering innovative solutions, fostering a culture of collaboration, and driving sustainable growth.</p>                    \n                        <p>Our vision is to be a pioneering force in our industry, shaping the future through innovation, creativity, and excellence. We aim to build a company that not only leads in performance.</p>                    \n                        <p>We are UNITE, based in Tamil Nadu, India, and established in 2018, we proudly serve clients worldwide, catering to their Mechanical, Civil, and Structural Steel Engineering needs. Our team comprises highly experienced engineers, committed to delivering excellence across every project.</p><p>We have an extensive portfolio spanning diverse sectors, including the commercial and industrial domains, with expertise in Oil &amp; Gas as well as Building and Infrastructure projects.</p><p>Our technical expertise, combined with streamlined process methodologies, ensures the delivery of responsive, high-quality, and cost-effective solutions. Equipped with cutting-edge 3D and 2D software tools, we consistently achieve precision and efficiency in our work.</p>                    \n            What We Offer<h4>Provide Quality Services</h4>        \n            <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/img-1.jpg\" alt=\"img-1\" /><h4>On-Site Supervision</h4><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/img-2.jpg\" alt=\"img-2\" /><h4>Architectural Design</h4><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/img-3.jpg\" alt=\"img-3\" /><h4>General Contracting</h4><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/img-4.jpg\" alt=\"img-4\" /><h4>Residential Interiors</h4><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/img-5.jpg\" alt=\"img-5\" /><h4>Custom Finishes</h4><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/img-6.jpg\" alt=\"img-6\" /><h4>Commercial Interiors</h4>        \n            <a id=\"eead-video-popup-aff262d\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"no\" data-video-type=\"youtube\" data-video-width=\"800px\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mbwuj58UEPg\" data-settings=\"{&quot;autoplay&quot;:0,&quot;controls&quot;:1,&quot;mute&quot;:false,&quot;loop&quot;:0,&quot;start&quot;:false,&quot;end&quot;:false}\">\n                            </a>\n            Why Choose US<h4>Modern Construction Challenges &amp; Solutions</h4>        \n		<p>The construc