ability concerns and regulatory compliance.</p>		\n                                                <label>Building Construction</label>\n                                    84%\n                                                <label>Interiors Design</label>\n                                    69%\n					        <a href=\"#\" >\n                Start Today            \n                    </a>\n            Working with us<h4>Trusted Builders &amp; Managers Since 1990</h4>        \n					        <a href=\"#\" >\n                Get a Quote            \n                    </a>\n            Our Works<h4>Latest Projects</h4>        \n                            Building                        \n                            House                        \n                            Bridge                        \n                            Mining                        \n                                <img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/building-1.jpg\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/building-1.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"no\">\n                                                                            </a>\n                                <img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/building-2.jpg\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/building-2.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"no\">\n                                                                            </a>\n                                <img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/building-3.jpg\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/building-3.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"no\">\n                                                                            </a>\n                                <img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/home-1.jpg\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/home-1.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"no\">\n                                                                            </a>\n                                <img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/home-2.jpg\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/home-2.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"no\">\n                                                                            </a>\n                                <img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/home-3.jpg\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/home-3.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"no\">\n                                                                            </a>\n                                <img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/bridge-1.jpg\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/bridge-1.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"no\">\n                                                                            </a>\n                                <img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/c