ements, delivery of results, and readiness for launch, implementation, or closure.</p>                        \n															<img width=\"650\" height=\"620\" src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/banner-img.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/banner-img.jpg 650w, https://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/banner-img-300x286.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" />','Projects','','inherit','closed','closed','','123-revision-v1','','','2025-05-06 16:42:00','2025-05-06 16:42:00','',123,'http://localhost:8080/?p=826',0,'revision','',0),(827,1,'2025-05-06 16:42:00','2025-05-06 16:42:00','<h1>Projects</h1>				\n            Our Works<h4>Latest Projects</h4>        \n                            All                        \n                            Bridge                        \n                            Building                        \n                            House                        \n                            Mining                        \n                                <img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/bridge-1.jpg\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/bridge-1.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"no\">\n                                                                            </a>\n                                <img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/bridge-2.jpg\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/bridge-2.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"no\">\n                                                                      