hance for connection.                    \n                    <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/team4.jpg\" alt=\"team4\" />\n                    <h6>Alena Due</h6>\n                            Make Up Artist                        \n            Our Blog<h4>Latest Insights and Updates</h4>        \n                                <h5><a href=\"http://localhost:8080/2025/05/01/stair-code-standards-in-steel-detailing/\">Stair Code Standards in Steel Detailing</a></h5>\n                                May 1, 2025\n                                Stairs play a crucial role in architecture, offering vertical connectivity between floors in multi-story buildings while fulfilling a functional purpose. Stairs are a structure that allows m...                            \n                                <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/2025/05/01/stair-code-standards-in-steel-detailing/\">Read More</a>\n                                <h5><a href=\"http://localhost:8080/2020/10/12/orna-science-lab-building/\">Orna Science Lab Building</a></h5>\n                                October 12, 2020\nInceptos laboris, fusce incidunt corporis necessitatibus eveniet, erat! Architecto! Nam debitis massa, semper facilis cras. Harum! Nisi facilis sociis sociosqu tempor distinctio vulputate! ...                            \n                                <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/2020/10/12/orna-science-lab-building/\">Read More</a>\n                                <h5><a href=\"http://localhost:8080/2020/10/12/demra-science-lab-building/\">Demra Science Lab Building</a></h5>\n                                October 12, 2020\nInceptos laboris, fusce incidunt corporis necessitatibus eveniet, erat! Architecto! Nam debitis massa, semper facilis cras. Harum! Nisi facilis sociis sociosqu tempor distinctio vulputate! ...                            \n                                <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/2020/10/12/demra-science-lab-building/\">Read More<