, design, implementation, and continuous improvement.</p>                        \n                        <h3>Scale and Deploy</h3>\n                            <p>Scale and Deploy refers to the process of expanding and implementing a solution efficiently and effectively. Scaling involves optimizing resources, infrastructure, or strategies to handle increased demand or growth.</p>                        \n                        <h3>Completion</h3>\n                            <p>Completion refers to the final stage of a project, task, or process where all objectives have been successfully achieved. It signifies the fulfillment of requirements, delivery of results, and readiness for launch, implementation, or closure.</p>                        \n															<img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/banner-img.jpg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />','Projects','','inherit','closed','closed','','123-revision-v1','','','2025-05-06 18:28:13','2025-05-06 18:28:13','',123,'http://localhost:8080/?p=960',0,'revision','',0),(961,1,'2025-05-06 18:34:20','2025-05-06 18:34:20','{\n    \"widget_custom_html[2]\": {\n        \"value\": {\n            \"encoded_serialized_instance\": \"YToyOntzOjU6InRpdGxlIjtzOjA6IiI7czo3OiJjb250ZW50IjtzOjA6IiI7fQ==\",\n            \"title\": \"Our Services\",\n            \"is_widget_customizer_js_value\": true,\n            \"instance_hash_key\": \"d8d91e0b40f19d9fc1fbc0e0e8340a81\",\n            \"raw_instance\": {\n                \"title\": \"\",\n                \"content\": \"\"\n            }\n        },\n        \"type\": \"option\",\n        \"user_id\": 1,\n        \"date_modified_gmt\": \"2025-05-06 18:34:20\"\n    }\n}','','','trash','closed','closed','','a59c1a68-5f29-4a16-9be1-1f59e6d2e2f7','','','2025-05-06 18:34:20','2025-05-06 18:34:20','',0,'http://localhost:8080/2025/05/06/a59c1a68-5f29-4a16-9be1-1f59e6d2e2f7/',0,'customize_changeset','',0),(962,1,'2025-05-06 18:37:04','2025-05-06 18:37:04','<h1>About Us</h1>				\n            About Our Company        \n		<p>We are UNITE, based in Tamil Nadu, India, and established in 2018, we proudly serve clients worldwide, catering to their Mechanical, Civil, and Structural Steel Engineering needs. Our team comprises highly experienced engineers, committed to delivering excellence across every project.</p><p>We have an extensive portfolio spanning diverse sectors, including the commercial and industrial domains, with expertise in Oil &amp; Gas as well as Building and Infrastructure projects.</p><p>Our technical expertise, combined with streamlined process methodologies, ensures the delivery of responsive, high-quality, and cost-effective solutions. Equipped with cutting-edge 3D and 2D software tools, we consistently achieve precision and efficiency in our work.</p>		\n            <ul>\n                                        <li>\n                                 Best Quality Support                            \n                                                    </li>\n                                                <li>\n                                100% Quality Design                            \n                                                    </li>\n                                                <li>\n                                 Professional Expertise                            \n                                                    </li>\n                                                <li>\n                                24/7 On Time Support                            \n                                                    </li>\n                                    </ul>\n            Why Choose Us<h4>We Know That Every Decision Has An Impact.</h4>        \n                    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" fill=\"#f66151\" id=\"Capa_1\" width=\"800px\" height=\"800px\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><g id=\"S