        <img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2021/07/teama.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />                \n                    <h4>Andrea Spliber</h4><h5>Project Manager</h5>                \n                    <img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2021/07/teamb.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />                \n                    <h4>Celsiya Malocm</h4><h5>Building Advisor</h5>                \n                    <img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2021/07/teamc.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />                \n                    <h4>Nelson Mecoy</h4><h5>Architecture</h5>                \n                    <img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2021/07/teamd.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />                \n                    <h4>Chris Russell</h4><h5>Builder</h5>                \n            Our Happy Clients<h4>We Care About Your Opinion</h4>        \n                        Turpis laborum cumque fugit aperiam doloremque in varius fugit tempore accusamus dui dolor, maxime maxime debitis, labore harum nonummy possimus aenean ad, integer leo adipiscing quia phasellus! Nec dictumst ab! Accumsan soluta, penatibus dignissim nonummy sit. Debitis doloremque dignissimos, nonummy.                    \n                    <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/team7.jpg\" alt=\"team7\" />\n                    <h6>Rengasamy</h6>\n                            CEO                        \n                        Quod occaecati class facilisis nihil augue do, nunc id perferendis provident fugit donec quasi. Atque odit gravida tincidunt excepteur, impedit! Donec soluta orci quibusdam, consequuntur diam omnis rem tortor eius scelerisque quo interdum auctor laudantium architecto adipisicing maxime corporis possimus.                    \n                    <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/team8.jpg\" alt=\"team8\" />\n                    <h6>Miya Martin</h6>\n                            Program Incharge                        \n                        Ultrices nec sem excepteur perspiciatis, quas sint eum. Facilis eleifend dis aliquid! Culpa nunc accusantium. Lacus mauris eaque, dui sequi suscipit magnis, sagittis ducimus, dui ullam nihil magnam ullamco blandit egestas voluptas! Sit! Vulputate voluptatibus aute, vel et possimus consectetur.                    \n                    <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/team4.jpg\" alt=\"team4\" />\n                    <h6>Alena Due</h6>\n                            Project Manger','About Us','','inherit','closed','closed','','121-revision-v1','','','2025-05-06 18:46:07','2025-05-06 18:46:07','',121,'http://localhost:8080/?p=975',0,'revision','',0),(976,1,'2025-05-06 18:46:07','2025-05-06 18:46:07','<h1>About Us</h1>				\n            About Our Company        \n		<p>We are UNITE, based in Tamil Nadu, India, and established in 2018, we proudly serve clients worldwide, catering to their Mechanical, Civil, and Structural Steel Engineering needs. Our team comprises highly experienced engineers, committed to delivering excellence across every project.</p><p>We have an extensive portfolio spanning diverse sectors, including the commercial and industrial domains, with expertise in Oil &amp; Gas as well as Building and Infrastructure projects.</p><p>Our technical expertise, combined with streamlined process methodologies, ensures the delivery of responsive, high-quality, and cost-effective solutions. Equipped with cutting-edge 3D and 2D software tools, we consistently achieve precision and efficiency in our work.</p>		\n            <ul>\n                                        <li>\n                                 Best Quality Support                            \n                                                    </li>\n                                                <li>\n                                100% Quality Design                            \n                                                    </li>\n                                                <li>\n                                 Professional Expertise                            \n                                                    </li>\n                                                <li>\n                                24/7 On Time Support                            \n                                                    </li>\n                                    </ul>\n            Why Choose Us<h4>We Know That Every Decision Has An Impact.</h4>        \n                    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" fill=\"#f66151\" id=\"Capa_1\" width=\"800px\" height=\"800px\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><g id=\"SVGRepo_bgCarrier\" stroke-width=\"0\"></g><g id=\"SVGRepo_tracerCarrier\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></g><g id=\"SVGRepo_iconCarrier\"> <g> <g> <polygon points=\"28.393,6.062 14.065,5.764 20.395,6.561 24.906,9.435 \"></polygon> <polygon points=\"19.912,6.815 5.534,4.842 1.94,7.873 16.409,11.733 \"></polygon> <path d=\"M16.753,23.762l14.075-7.326V8.183l-2.057-2.121l-3.816,3.764l-4.622-2.915l-3.58,5.182V23.762z M26.316,13.281 l3.523-1.358v0.494l-3.523,1.41V13.281z M26.316,14.223l3.523-1.443v0.494l-3.523,1.496V14.223z M26.316,15.107l3.523-1.529v0.494 l-3.523,1.58V15.107z M26.316,15.95l3.523-1.609v0.495l-3.523,1.66V15.95z M18.455,16.204l5.07-1.943v0.588l-5.07,2.019V16.204z M18.455,17.346l5.07-2.067v0.588l-5.07,2.141V17.346z M18.455,18.416l5.07-2.188v0.587l-5.07,2.263V18.416z M18.455,19.439 l5.07-2.305v0.587l-5.07,2.378V19.439z\"></path> <path d=\"M16.223,12.118L1.856,8.241v8.149l14.365,7.365V12.118H16.223z M3.927,11.948l-1.485-0.537V9.318l1.484,0.443 L3.927,11.948L3.927,11.948z M6.279,12.837L4