.826 99.631l-15.694 6.082z\"></path></svg>                \n                            <h4>\n                        MISCELLANEOUS STRUCTURES                    \n                </h4>\n                        <p>Miscellaneous structures encompass a variety of building elements and types that don&#8217;t fit neatly into a specific category, but are essential for a complete construction project.</p>                    \n            Industry Certifications<h4>Our Key Achievements Over the Years</h4>        \n                                +                            \n                            1                        \n                    <h4>\n                        Complete Projects                    </h4>\n                                +                            \n                            1                        \n                    <h4>\n                        Team Members                    </h4>\n                                +                            \n                            1                        \n                    <h4>\n                        Client Reviews                    </h4>\n                                +                            \n                            1                        \n                    <h4>\n                        Winning Awards                    </h4>\n            Team Members<h4>Our Key Achievements Over the Years</h4>        \n                    <img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2021/07/teama.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />                \n                    <h4>Andrea Spliber</h4><h5>Project Manager</h5>                \n                    <img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2021/07/teamb.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />                \n                    <h4>Celsiya Malocm</h4><h5>Building Advisor</h5>                \n                    <img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2021/07/teamc.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />                \n                    <h4>Nelson Mecoy</h4><h5>Architecture</h5>                \n                    <img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2021/07/teamd.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />                \n                    <h4>Chris Russell</h4><h5>Builder</h5>                \n            Our Happy Clients<h4>We Care About Your Opinion</h4>        \n                        Dark troubles, someone on the run, opens up to pain and shifting accusations over time — severe, persistent pain, burdensome obligations, work, distress — possible elegance in a noble form, leaning toward clarity and purpose. From structured law: freedom granted, dignified refinement in noble posture. Burdens and dignities, again with that refinement.                    \n                    <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/team7.jpg\" alt=\"team7\" />\n                    <h6>Rengasamy</h6>\n                            CEO                        \n                        Because of hidden matters, a certain class or category offers no real value — now entrusted with fleeting duties, almost finished. Harsh judgments and deep burdens emerge. Yet freedom lies in simple structure, though complications follow. Certain consequences take shape, surrounding everything with tension and design. Still, through disorder and conflict, there’s strength, honor, and the possibility of rising above.                    \n                    <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/team8.jpg\" alt=\"team8\" />\n                    <h6>Miya Martin</h6>\n                            Program Incharge                        \n                        Troubles grow subtly, hidden yet clear to some — who he is, what he carries. Simple movements reveal something deeper. He is now blamed. In the depths, as he follows great burdens, he moves forward — pursued and empty, yet filled with a kind of grace and purpose. Pause. In the tension of desires and the weight of expectations, there is potential, beauty, and the chance for connection.                    \n                    <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/team4.jpg\" alt=\"team4\" />\n                    <h6>Alena Due</h6>\n                            Project Manger','About Us','','inherit','closed','closed','','121-revision-v1','','','2025-05-06 18:48:45','2025-05-06 18:48:45','',121,'http://localhost:8080/?p=982',0,'revision','',0),(983,1,'2025-05-06 18:48:45','2025-05-06 18:48:45','<h1>About Us</h1>				\n            About Our Company        \n		<p>We are UNITE, based in Tamil Nadu, India, and established in 2018, we proudly serve clients worldwide, catering to their Mechanical, Civil, and Structural Steel Engineering needs. Our team comprises highly experienced engineers, committed to delivering excellence across every project.</p><p>We have an extensive portfolio spanning diverse sectors, including the commercial and industrial domains, with expertise in Oil &amp; Gas as well as Building and Infrastructure projects.</p><p>Our technical expertise, combined with streamlined process methodologies, ensures the delivery of responsive, high-quality, and cost-effective solutions. Equipped with cutting-edge 3D and 2D software tools, we consistently achieve precision and efficiency in our work.</p>		\n            <ul>\n                                        <li>\n                                 Best Quality Support                            \n                                                    </li>\n                                                <li>\n                                100% Quality Design                            \n                                                    </li>\n                                                <li>\n                                 Professional Expertise                            \n                                                    </li>\n                                                <li>\n                                24/7 On Time Support                            \n                                                    </li>\n                                    </ul>\n            Why Choose Us<h4>We Know That Every Decision Has An Impact.</h4>        \n                    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" fill=\"#f66151\" id=\"Capa_1\" width=\"800px\" height=\"800px\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><g id=\"SVGRepo_bgCarrier\" stroke-width=\"0\"></g><g id=\"SVGRepo_tracerCarrier\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></g><g id=\"SVGRepo_iconCarrier\"> <g> <g> <polygon points=\"28.393,6.062 14.065,5.764 20.395,6.561 24.906,9.435 \"></polygon> <polygon points=\"19.912,6.815 5.534,4.842 1.94,7.873 16.409,11.733 \"></polygon> <path d=\"M16.753,23.762l14.075-7.326V8.183l-2.057-2.121l-3.816,3.764l-4.622-2.915l-3.58,5.182V23.762z M26.316,13.281 l3.523-1.358v0.494l-3.523,1.41V13.281z M26.316,14.223l3.523-1.443v0.494l-3.523,1.496V14.223z M26.316,15.107l3.523-1.529v0.494 l-3.523,1.58V15.107z M26.316,15.95l3.523-1.609v0.495l-3.523,1.66V15.95z M18.455,16.204l5.07-1.943v0.588l-5.07,2.019V16.204z M18.455,17.346l5.07-2.067v0.588l-5.07,2.141V17.346z M18.455,18.416l5.07-2.188v0.587l-5.07,2.263V18.416z M18.455,19.439 l5.07-2.305v0.587l-5.07,2.378V19.439z\"></path> <path d=\"M16.223,12.118L1.856,8.241v8.149l14.365,7.365V12.118H16.223z M3.927,11.948l-1.485-0.537V9.318l1.484,0.443 L3.927,11.948L3.927,11.948z M6.279,12.837L4.59,12.224v-2.23L6.279,10.5V12.837z M8.886,13.736l-1.931-0.7v-2.381l1.931,0.577 V13.736z M11.905,14.838l-2.228-0.807v-2.553l2.229,0.665L11.905,14.838L11.905,14.838z M15.403,16.043l-2.601-0.939v-2.751 l2.601,0.772V16.043z\"></path> <polygon points=\"32,16.273 16.428,24.598 0,15.808 0,17.459 16.434,27.1