x=\"no\">\n                                                                            </a>\n                                <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/v3images.jpg\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/v3images.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"no\">\n                                                                            </a>\n                                <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/v5images.jpg\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/v5images.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"no\">\n                                                                            </a>\n                                <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/sddefault.jpg\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/sddefault.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"no\">\n                                                                            </a>\n            How We Work<h4>We get it right the first time</h4>        \n                        <h3>Identify and Simplify</h3>\n                            <p>Identify and Simplify refers to the process of recognizing key elements, patterns, or complexities in a given situation, problem, or concept and then reducing them to their essential components for better understanding and efficiency.</p>                        \n                        <h3>Build and Develop</h3>\n                            <p>Build and Develop refers to the process of creating, enhancing, and refining projects, products, or ideas from concept to completion. It involves strategic planning, design, implementation, and continuous improvement.</p>                        \n                        <h3>Scale and Deploy</h3>\n                            <p>Scale and Deploy refers to the process of expanding and implementing a solution efficiently and effectively. Scaling involves optimizing resources, infrastructure, or strategies to handle increased demand or growth.</p>                        \n                        <h3>Completion</h3>\n                            <p>Completion refers to the final stage of a project, task, or process where all objectives have been successfully achieved. It signifies the fulfillment of requirements, delivery of results, and readiness for launch, implementation, or closure.</p>                        \n															<img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/banner-img.jpg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />','Projects','','inherit','closed','closed','','123-revision-v1','','','2025-05-06 18:49:31','2025-05-06 18:49:31','',123,'http://localhost:8080/?p=984',0,'revision','',0),(985,1,'2025-05-06 18:49:31','2025-05-06 18:49:31','<h1>Projects</h1>				\n            Our Works<h4>Latest Projects</h4>        \n                            All                        \n                            APOC PP PLANT                        \n                            CHILDREN’S PARK                        \n                            PERDAMAN CHEMICALS                        \n                            VILLAGE MD                        \n                                <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/apcimages-1.jpg\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/apcimages-1.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"no\">\n                                                                            </a>\n                                <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/appimages-1.jpg\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"htt