mpletion refers to the final stage of a project, task, or process where all objectives have been successfully achieved. It signifies the fulfillment of requirements, delivery of results, and readiness for launch, implementation, or closure.</p>                        \n															<img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/banner-img.jpg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />','Projects','','inherit','closed','closed','','123-revision-v1','','','2025-05-06 18:49:31','2025-05-06 18:49:31','',123,'http://localhost:8080/?p=986',0,'revision','',0),(987,1,'2025-05-06 18:49:59','2025-05-06 18:49:59','<h1>Contact Us</h1>				\n            Contact Us<h4>Get in touch with Unite</h4>        \n									<h4>\n							Contact Phone						\n					</h4>\n									<p>\n						+91 90259 63647 <br>\n+91 95436 69218					</p>\n									<h3>\n							Contact Mail						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						ute@unitete.com					</p>\n									<h3>\n							Contact Location						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						<strong>Registered: </strong>18, Ezhil nagar, Keeranur, <br>Pudukottai - Tamilnadu - India. <br>\n<strong>Business:</strong> 107/1, Samanthi street, J K Nagar, <br>Trichy - Tamilnadu - India.					</p>\n									<h3>\n							Opening Hours						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						Mon- Fri: 10.00 - 07.00					</p>\n            Get In Touch<h4>We’d love to hear from you</h4>        \n            <form enctype=\"multipart/form-data\" method=\"post\" id=\"hf-form-id-g0kwmj\" novalidate>\n        <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"hashform_action\" value=\"create\" />\n        <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"form_id\" value=\"1\" />\n        <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"form_key\" value=\"g0kwmj\" />\n        <input type=\"hidden\" value=\"[]\" />\n        <input type=\"hidden\" id=\"hashform_submit_entry_1\" name=\"hashform_submit_entry_1\" value=\"54a8ecbe15\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wp_http_referer\" value=\"/wp-admin/admin-ajax.php\" />      