r Mechanical, Civil, and Structural Steel Engineering needs. Our team comprises highly experienced engineers, committed to delivering excellence across every project.</p>		\n                                                Our Mission\n                                                Our Vision\n                                                Our History\n                        <p>Our mission in building this company is to create a lasting impact by delivering innovative solutions, fostering a culture of collaboration, and driving sustainable growth.</p>                    \n                        <p>Our vision is to be a pioneering force in our industry, shaping the future through innovation, creativity, and excellence. We aim to build a company that not only leads in performance.</p>                    \n                        <p>We are UNITE, based in Tamil Nadu, India, and established in 2018, we proudly serve clients worldwide, catering to their Mechanical, Civil, and Structural Steel Engineering needs. Our team comprises highly experienced engineers, committed to delivering excellence across every project.</p><p>We have an extensive portfolio spanning diverse sectors, including the commercial and industrial domains, with expertise in Oil &amp; Gas as well as Building and Infrastructure projects.</p><p>Our technical expertise, combined with streamlined process methodologies, ensures the delivery of responsive, high-quality, and cost-effective solutions. Equipped with cutting-edge 3D and 2D software tools, we consistently achieve precision and efficiency in our work.</p>                    \n            What We Offer<h4>Provide Quality Services</h4>        \n            <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/img-1.jpg\" alt=\"img-1\" /><h4>On-Site Supervision</h4><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/img-2.jpg\" alt=\"img-2\" /><h4>Architectural Design</h4><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/img-3.jpg\" alt=\"img-3\" /><h4>General Contracting</h4><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/img-4.jpg\" alt=\"img-4\" /><h4>Residential Interiors</h4><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/img-5.jpg\" alt=\"img-5\" /><h4>Custom Finishes</h4><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/img-6.jpg\" alt=\"img-6\" /><h4>Commercial Interiors</h4>        \n            <a id=\"eead-video-popup-aff262d\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"no\" data-video-type=\"youtube\" data-video-width=\"800px\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mbwuj58UEPg\" data-settings=\"{&quot;autoplay&quot;:0,&quot;controls&quot;:1,&quot;mute&quot;:false,&quot;loop&quot;:0,&quot;start&quot;:false,&quot;end&quot;:false}\">\n                            </a>\n            Why Choose US<h4>Modern Construction Challenges &amp; Solutions</h4>        \n		<p>The construction industry is constantly evolving, facing a variety of challenges that demand innovative solutions. From rising material costs and labor shortages to sustainability concerns and regulatory compliance.</p>		\n                                                <label>Building Construction</label>\n                                    84%\n                                                <label>Interiors Design</label>\n                                    69%\n            Working with us<h4>Trusted Builders &amp; Managers Since 1990</h4>        \n					        <a href=\"#\" >\n                Get a Quote            \n                    </a>\n            Our Works<h4>Latest Projects</h4>        \n                            APOC PP PLANT                        \n                            CHILDREN’S PARK                        \n                            PERDAMAN CHEMICALS                        \n                            VILLAGE MD                        \n                                <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/FullWidth.jpg\">\n                    