o\">\n                                                                            </a>\n                                <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/apoc-7.jpg\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/apoc-7.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"no\">\n                                                                            </a>\n                                <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/11197-17863537.jpg\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/11197-17863537.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"no\">\n                                                                            </a>\n                                <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/apoc-5.jpg\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/apoc-5.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"no\">\n                                                                            </a>\n                                <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/cimages.jpg\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/cimages.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"no\">\n                                                                            </a>\n                                <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Untitled4.jpg\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Untitled4.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"no\">\n                                                                            </a>\n                                <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Web_Photo_Editor.jpg\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Web_Photo_Editor.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"no\">\n                                                                            </a>\n                                <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/3N18N6-1.png\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/3N18N6-1.png\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"no\">\n                                                                            </a>\n                                <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/egV4Pv.jpg\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/egV4Pv.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"no\">\n                                                                            </a>\n            <h4>List Of Projects</h4>        \n                        <h3>Project: APOC PP PLANT</h3>\n                            <p>Project Summary:</p><p>We successfully completed the following</p><p>Modelling and detailing of accessing platforms and staircases for two loop reactors .</p><p>Modelling and detailing of 30 circular platforms.</p><p>These projects have significantly enhanced our expertise and knowledge, preparing us to take on more challenging and ambitious endeavours in the future.<br /><br />Location : SAUDI ARABIA<br /><br />Tonnage : 450 Tons</p>                        \n                        <h3>Project: HAWIYAH EAST WEST GAS</h3>\n                            <p>Project Summary:</p><p>We successfully completed the Modelling and detailing of accessing platforms, pipe supports, and ring girders.</p><p>The project was completed successfully, and the models were seamlessly integrated into a single file for Building Information Modelling (BIM).</p><p>Additionally, we designed the connections for the pipe supports.<br /><br />Location : SAUDI ARABIA<br /><br />Tonnage : 200 Tons</p>                        \n                        <h3>Project: FIRE WATER PUMP STATION BULIDING</h3>\n                            <p>Project Summary:</p><p>We successfully completed the modelling and detailing of the fire water pump station building structure.</p><p>Through this project, we gained valuable insights into PEP building standards.<br /><br />Location : OMAN<br /><br />Tonnage : 125 Tons</p>                        \n                        <h3>Project: KALLANG FOOTBALL HUB</h3>\n                            <p>Project Summary:</p><p>We take pride in successfully completing the modification and detailing work for a football stadium.</p><p>This project posed significant challenges, as it involved implementing design change modifications and corrections. Through our dedicated efforts, we delivered results that fully met the client’s expectations and requirements.<br /><br />Location : SINGAPORE<br /><br />Tonnage : 750 Tons</p>                        \n                        <h3>Project: PERDAMAN CHEMICALS</h3>\n                            <p>Project Summary:</p><p>We successfully completed the modelling and detailing of skids.<br />This project provided valuable insights into trade coordination, particularly with piping and equipment.<br /><br />Location : AUSTRALIA<br /><br />Tonnage : 20 Tons (10 Skids)</p>                        \n															<img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/banner-img.jpg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />','Projects','','inherit','closed','closed','','123-revision-v1','','','2025-05-07 18:04:40','2025-05-07 18:04:40','',123,'http://localhost:8080/?p=1038',0,'revision','',0),(1039,1,'2025-05-07 18:05:36','2025-05-07 18:05:36','<h1>Projects</h1>				\n            Our Works<h4>Latest P