s were securely integrated with the concrete, ensuring a smooth process without any erection issues.<br /><br />Location : USA<br /><br />Tonnage : 7.5 Tons<br /> <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/3N18N6-1-239x300.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"239\" height=\"300\" /><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/egV4Pv-225x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"300\" /></p>                        \n                        <h3>Project: CHILDREN’S PARK</h3>\n                            <p>Project Summary:</p><p>We successfully completed the modelling and detailing of a truss.</p><p>Despite challenges in achieving the truss valley during modelling, we gained valuable insights from the visually simple truss park.<br /><br />Location : SAUDI ARABIA<br /><br />Tonnage : 40 Tons (4 Sets)<br /><br /><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/apoc-8-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" /> <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/apoc-7-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" /></p>                        \n															<img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/banner-img.jpg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />','Projects','','inherit','closed','closed','','123-revision-v1','','','2025-05-07 18:17:00','2025-05-07 18:17:00','',123,'http://localhost:8080/?p=1048',0,'revision','',0),(1049,1,'2025-05-07 18:17:00','2025-05-07 18:17:00','<h1>Projects</h1>				\n            Our Works<h4>Latest Projects</h4>        \n                            All                        \n                            APOC PP PLANT                        \n                            CHILDREN’S PARK                        \n                            PERDAMAN CHEMICALS                        \n                            VILLAGE MD                        \n                                <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/L