eactors .</p><p>Modelling and detailing of 30 circular platforms.</p><p>These projects have significantly enhanced our expertise and knowledge, preparing us to take on more challenging and ambitious endeavours in the future.</p><p>Location : SAUDI ARABIA</p><p>Tonnage : 450 Tons</p><p><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Circular-platform-132x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"132\" height=\"300\" /> <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Loop-Reactor-155x300.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"155\" height=\"300\" /><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Small-Circular-platform-1-251x300.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"251\" height=\"300\" /></p>                        \n                        <h3>HAWIYAH EAST WEST GAS</h3>\n                            <p>Project Summary:</p><p>We successfully completed the Modelling and detailing of accessing platforms, pipe supports, and ring girders.</p><p>The project was completed successfully, and the models were seamlessly integrated into a single file for Building Information Modelling (BIM).</p><p>Additionally, we designed the connections for the pipe supports.</p><p>Location : SAUDI ARABIA</p><p>Tonnage : 200 Tons</p><p><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Scraper-Launcher-and-Receiver-project-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" /><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Scraper-Launcher-and-Receiver-project-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" /><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Web_Photo_Editor1-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" /></p>                        \n                        <h3>FIRE WATER PUMP STATION BULIDING</h3>\n                            <p>Project Summary:</p><p>We successfully completed the modelling and detailing of the fire water pump station building structure.</p><p>Through this project, we gained valuable insights into PEP building standards.</p><p>Location : OMAN</