                            <p>Project Summary:</p><p>We successfully completed the modelling and detailing of a truss.</p><p>Despite challenges in achieving the truss valley during modelling, we gained valuable insights from the visually simple truss park.</p><p>Location : SAUDI ARABIA</p><p>Tonnage : 40 Tons (4 Sets)</p><p><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/apoc-8-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" /> <img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/apoc-7-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" /></p>                        \n															<img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/banner-img.jpg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />','Projects','','inherit','closed','closed','','123-autosave-v1','','','2025-05-07 18:19:23','2025-05-07 18:19:23','',123,'http://localhost:8080/?p=1053',0,'revision','',0),(1054,1,'2025-05-07 18:21:39','2025-05-07 18:21:39','<img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/slider-1.jpg\">                                                            \n                                            WE ARE  UNITE TECHNOCRATS                                        \n                            <img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/slider-2.jpg\">                                                            \n                                            WE ARE DOING STRUCTURAL DESIGN                                        \n                            <img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/slider-3.jpg\">                                                            \n                                            WE ARE DESIGN, DETAILING, FABRICATION                                        \n            Welcome to<h4>Unite Technocrats Engineering</h4>        \n		<p>We are UNITE, based in 