6','2025-05-07 18:27:26','',6,'http://localhost:8080/?p=1071',0,'revision','',0),(1072,1,'2025-05-07 18:33:11','2025-05-07 18:33:11','<h1>Structural Steel Detailing</h1>				\n            We Can Build Anything<h4>Steel\nDetailing</h4>        \n		<p>Our steel detailing service is a specialized service that focuses on creating highly precise and accurate drawings for steel structures. We work with architects, engineers, and contractors to ensure that the steel structure is designed and built to the highest quality standards and meets all local building codes and safety regulations. Our team of experienced detailers uses the latest software and technology to create detailed shop and erection drawings, including:</p><ul><li><strong>Plans:</strong> Showing the layout of the steel structure from above, including the location of all steel members.</li><li><strong>Elevations:</strong> Showing the steel structure from the side, including the height of each steel member.</li><li><strong>Sections:</strong> Showing the steel structure in cross-section, including the thickness and size of each steel member.</li><li><strong>Details:</strong> Showing the specific connections and joints between steel members, including bolts, welds, and other fasteners.<br /><br />In addition to these drawings, we also provide material lists, connection designs, and erection plans to ensure that the steel structure is built to the highest quality standards. Our steel detailing service is ideal for all types of steel structures, including bridges, buildings, and industrial facilities.<br /><img src=\"https://www.esskaystructures.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/steel-detailing-model.webp\" sizes=\"(max-width: 625px) 100vw, 625px\" srcset=\"https://www.esskaystructures.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/steel-detailing-model.webp 625w, https://www.esskaystructures.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/steel-detailing-model-300x273.webp 300w\" alt=\"steel detailing services\" width=\"625\" height=\"568\" data-lazyloaded=\"1\" data-src=\"https://www.esskaystructures.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/steel-detailing-model.webp\" data-srcset=\"https://www.esskaystructures.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/steel-detailing-model.webp 625w, https://www.esskaystructures.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/steel-detailing-model-300x273.webp 300w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 625px) 100vw, 625px\" data-ll-status=\"loaded\" /></li></ul>		\n					        <a href=\"#\" >\n                Apply For Services            \n                    </a>\n            Working with us<h4>Trusted Builders &amp; Managers Since 1990</h4>        \n					        <a href=\"#\" >\n                Get a Quote            \n                    </a>\n            what we offer<h4>We Provide Excellent Service </h4>        \n                                            <img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/building-construction.jpg\" alt=\"Building Construction\">\n                            <h4>\n                        Building Construction                    \n                </h4>\n                        <p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"137\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Process of designing, assembling, and completing structures using materials, engineering, and skilled labor.</p>                    \n                                <a href=\"#\">\n                View More            </a>\n                                            <img src=\"http://demo.hashthemes.com/total/construction/wp-content/uploads/sites/9/2025/02/architecture-design.jpg\" alt=\"Architecture Design\">\n                            <h4>\n                        Architecture Design                    \n                </h4>\n                        <p>The art and science of planning, designing, and constructing buildings and spaces for functionality and sustainability.</p>                    \n                                <a href=\"#\">\n                View More            </a>\